5. Keep shadows subtle and borders understated.
6. Use consistent corner radii, spacing, typography, and button sizes.
7. Avoid introducing unrelated bright colors throughout the interface.
8. For map markers, status labels, warnings, and error states, use accessible semantic colors only where necessary.
9. Do not mix in the previous dark-pink branding palette.
10. Keep the overall design elegant, readable, and visually consistent.

